@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+"@durable-streams/client": patch
+"@durable-streams/state": patch
+---
+
+Add guarded projection snapshot loading, publication, and committed StreamDB bootstrap/export support.
+
+Canonical export requires explicit coherent capture via onCommittedBatch. Without that callback, legacy sync visibility is preserved and exportState rejects rather than pairing queued/stale rows with an advanced cursor.
